  "blocks": {
    "\"It's running against a different filesystem — the sandbox mounted the parent dir, not the project root. Repoint the harness.\"": "“它运行在另一个文件系统上——<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/sandbox\">沙箱</a>挂载的是父目录，不是项目根目录。重新设置运行框架的目标路径。”",
    "\"Why isn't it picking up my AGENTS.md?\"": "“为什么它没有读取我的 AGENTS.md？”",
    "A tree of files and directories the agent reads from, writes to, and executes within — the default kind of environment for a coding agent. AGENTS.md, skills, source code, build scripts, and tool configs all live in a filesystem. When a harness \"starts in your project,\" it's pointing the agent at a filesystem.": "文件系统是由文件和目录组成的树，<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>在其中读取、写入和执行操作；它是编码智能体最常见的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/environment\">环境</a>。<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agents-md\">AGENTS.md</a>、<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/skill\">技能</a>、源代码、构建脚本和<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool\">工具</a>配置都存在于文件系统中。当<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/harness\">运行框架</a>“在你的项目中启动”时，它实际上是在让智能体指向一个文件系统。",
    "And it's shared with you. The files the agent edits are the same ones you open in your editor and diff in git — the filesystem is the common workspace where you review what the agent did.": "文件系统也与你共享。智能体编辑的文件，就是你在编辑器中打开、在 git 中查看 diff 的同一批文件——文件系统是你审查智能体工作的共同工作空间。",
    "The agent touches it only through tool calls — reading a file, writing one, running a shell command. Nothing on disk is in the context window until a tool call loads it, which is what lets the agent work in a repository far larger than the window: the filesystem holds everything, the context holds only what the current task has read. Some harnesses do load the current directory's filenames into the context window by default — not the contents, just the tree — which act as context pointers: the agent sees what exists and reads the files it needs.": "智能体只能通过<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/tool-call\">工具调用</a>接触文件系统——读取文件、写入文件或运行 shell 命令。在工具调用加载之前，磁盘上的任何内容都不在<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>中。正因如此，智能体才能处理远大于窗口容量的仓库：文件系统保存全部内容，上下文只保存当前任务实际读取的部分。有些运行框架会默认把当前目录中的文件名加载进上下文窗口——只加载目录树，不加载正文——这些名称会成为<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-pointer\">上下文指针</a>：智能体先看到有哪些内容，再读取所需文件。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
